WEBVTT

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

00:11.030 --> 00:15.780
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

00:15.950 --> 00:20.200
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

00:20.370 --> 00:24.000
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>are itsukarada?</i>

00:32.840 --> 00:36.180
<i>Since when was it?</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>honne ga yowane ni nattana</i>

00:36.340 --> 00:39.100
<i>Being honest became whining</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>nigenai koto ga tsuyosa ni natta</i>

00:39.260 --> 00:41.640
<i>Standing firm became strength</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>Have you found it yet?</i>

00:41.810 --> 00:44.940
<i>naa mitsukaranai?</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>Not confidence, your true self</i>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.320
<i>jishin janaku jibun jishin</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>There must be something
I've forgotten that I still haven't found</i>

00:50.610 --> 00:54.820
<i>kitto mada sagasetenai wasuremono ga aruhazu</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>Words I want to say
That I still haven't said</i>

00:54.990 --> 00:59.160
<i>zutto mada tsutaetenai tsutaetai kotoba</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>If you would watch me, I'd captivate you</i>

00:59.330 --> 01:04.500
<i>mitete kurerunara misete miserunoni</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>Truly loving myself</i>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.500
<i>boku ga boku wo aishinuku koto</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>Is it alright to still believe in that?</i>

01:09.710 --> 01:13.670
<i>naa mada shinjitemo iika?</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>I smolder because I've actually burned</i>

01:13.840 --> 01:17.720
<i>kusuburuno wa chanto moeta karada</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>No matter where this journey takes us</i>

01:17.890 --> 01:22.810
<i>doko e mukau tabi datoshitemo</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>I'll just open my eyes</i>

01:22.970 --> 01:27.770
<i>tada me wo mihiraite</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>And dream my dream</i>

01:27.940 --> 01:31.520
<i>yume wo miru</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>And know my dream</i>

01:31.690 --> 01:33.860
<i>yume wo shiru</i>

01:42.370 --> 01:50.580
FAREWELL TO THE FATHER

02:06.020 --> 02:10.730
Crocodine, do you have any strength left
to throw me up there?

02:10.730 --> 02:11.900
What?

02:11.900 --> 02:16.200
You trying to fight in the air
won't make any difference.

02:16.200 --> 02:17.240
I know.

02:17.610 --> 02:19.410
Then why?

02:19.410 --> 02:21.320
The same as you.

02:23.530 --> 02:29.290
What kind of man would watch
someone die like that and do nothing?

02:30.540 --> 02:31.500
Okay!

02:41.340 --> 02:42.220
Ready?!

02:42.220 --> 02:45.180
Not yet! The timing is everything!

02:53.610 --> 02:54.690
It's over!

02:54.980 --> 02:55.730
Now!

03:03.530 --> 03:05.160
You filthy trash!

03:10.290 --> 03:12.670
Your pitiful attacks won't...

03:20.170 --> 03:22.600
Dai! Use that!

03:22.600 --> 03:27.560
It's not as strong as Baran's,
but it's still a Legendary Dark Blade!

03:28.890 --> 03:32.940
So that was his plan from the start!

03:32.940 --> 03:34.610
Curse you!

03:42.030 --> 03:44.620
Hyunckel, are you all right?!

03:44.620 --> 03:46.370
I'll heal you!

03:46.870 --> 03:49.790
<i>Dai, finish it in one shot.</i>

03:49.790 --> 03:56.170
<i>Not even the Dark Armour Blade
can endure your power for long.</i>

03:58.250 --> 04:00.210
Yes! This'll work!

04:12.850 --> 04:15.730
I could tell when our blades crossed!

04:15.730 --> 04:20.070
That weapon isn't as strong
as my Demon Dragon Blade!

04:20.070 --> 04:22.650
I'll shatter it in one blow...

04:23.200 --> 04:26.660
with my ultimate attack, Gigabreak!

04:27.780 --> 04:30.740
That's not a true Gigabreak!

04:31.870 --> 04:35.370
The spell you just used was Zapple!

04:36.670 --> 04:37.630
That's it!

04:38.090 --> 04:42.380
You don't have enough Magic Power
to use Kazap anymore!

04:43.090 --> 04:44.760
If it's the same spell...

04:45.720 --> 04:47.430
we'll win!

04:49.350 --> 04:50.470
A Zapple spell!

04:53.930 --> 04:55.770
With my power...

04:56.190 --> 04:57.860
and Master's attack...

04:58.560 --> 05:00.320
and Hyunckel's blade...

05:00.980 --> 05:03.110
<i>All his power is in the blade!</i>

05:03.940 --> 05:04.780
<i>And...</i>

05:06.070 --> 05:11.330
the all of the memories
that Popp restored.

05:14.200 --> 05:16.340
That's what I'll hit you with!

05:16.340 --> 05:18.580
Silence!

06:15.020 --> 06:17.270
Why aren't they using their attacks?

06:17.270 --> 06:21.900
Because they both know
their next attack will be their last.

06:22.400 --> 06:26.570
Whoever offers the slightest opening
will lose this fight.

06:26.900 --> 06:29.240
<i>Good luck, Dai.</i>

06:30.360 --> 06:32.320
<i>For Popp, too.</i>

06:33.080 --> 06:36.950
<i>It's no good.
He's not responding to my Zing spell.</i>

06:37.450 --> 06:38.910
<i>At this rate...</i>

06:39.420 --> 06:43.420
<i>Please! Come back to us, Popp!</i>

06:58.020 --> 07:01.440
What happened to me?

07:01.440 --> 07:04.150
Did I die?

07:04.150 --> 07:06.980
Well, I used Megante, so obviously...

07:11.450 --> 07:12.820
Megante?!

07:13.240 --> 07:14.490
Where's Baran?!

07:15.030 --> 07:16.700
He's not here.

07:17.330 --> 07:22.090
So if this is the afterlife, he went
to a different afterlife or something?

07:22.090 --> 07:23.130
Popp!

07:23.130 --> 07:24.380
Popp!

07:24.380 --> 07:26.380
Huh? Who's there?

07:26.380 --> 07:27.880
It's me!

07:28.300 --> 07:30.350
You're... Gome?!

07:30.350 --> 07:31.350
Popp!

07:31.350 --> 07:33.470
Well, what do you know.

07:33.840 --> 07:38.980
Gome's talking. I guess
anything's possible in the afterlife.

07:38.980 --> 07:42.440
Wait, does that mean you're dead, too?

07:42.440 --> 07:45.360
Popp, don't go that way!

07:45.360 --> 07:50.570
You'll enter the Land of the Dead
and you won't be able to come back!

07:50.570 --> 07:51.580
Huh?

07:51.580 --> 07:58.040
Even if you say that,
my feet keep moving and won't stop.

07:58.040 --> 08:03.050
Get a grip, Popp! You can't die here!

08:03.050 --> 08:06.800
We've come all this way together!

08:06.800 --> 08:09.890
If you die, I...

08:09.890 --> 08:11.260
I...

08:14.550 --> 08:18.510
Sorry, Gome. But it's over for me.

08:19.310 --> 08:22.980
It's a miracle I lived this long.

08:23.640 --> 08:27.560
My strength could only take me so far.

08:27.940 --> 08:29.530
Popp...

08:35.490 --> 08:40.330
Stupid Popp! You weakling!

08:43.290 --> 08:45.250
What?!

09:07.730 --> 09:09.320
He fell for it!

09:09.860 --> 09:12.030
I hate you, Popp!

09:12.480 --> 09:17.370
You haven't even avenged Master Avan
and you're giving up!

09:17.370 --> 09:19.500
You're a weakling, Popp!

09:19.500 --> 09:25.880
Why you little...! I'm not letting
a crybaby like you call me a weakling!

09:25.880 --> 09:28.960
I tried as hard as I could!

09:28.960 --> 09:30.290
You liar!

09:32.380 --> 09:34.170
You're still a child!

09:34.840 --> 09:39.430
You don't have my battle experience!

09:51.980 --> 09:53.280
<i>Dai's still...</i>

09:53.730 --> 09:55.400
fighting alone out there!

10:05.580 --> 10:06.710
<i>And yet...</i>

10:06.710 --> 10:08.920
you're abandoning him!

10:08.920 --> 10:12.250
You're pathetic! You're just a weakling!

10:27.850 --> 10:30.530
Watch your mouth, Stupid Gome.

10:30.530 --> 10:31.770
Huh?

10:32.230 --> 10:33.360
I...

10:34.070 --> 10:36.820
I may be dead, but I'll...

10:37.650 --> 10:38.950
I'll...

10:39.740 --> 10:41.500
This is the end!

10:41.500 --> 10:44.410
Fall to my Gigabreak!

10:44.700 --> 10:45.740
I'll...!

10:48.580 --> 10:54.960
I'll never abandon Dai!

11:15.940 --> 11:19.650
<i>Impossible! A corpse cast a spell?!</i>

11:25.240 --> 11:28.160
Now!

11:33.040 --> 11:37.880
Avan Strash!

12:10.950 --> 12:12.870
A-A draw?!

12:24.970 --> 12:27.550
AVAN STRASH

12:29.970 --> 12:32.560
GIGABREAK

12:36.480 --> 12:37.980
Dai!

12:41.570 --> 12:42.530
He's alive!

12:42.530 --> 12:43.530
Oh!

12:43.530 --> 12:44.490
Dai!

12:49.080 --> 12:50.040
Thanks.

12:50.040 --> 12:51.380
Are you all right?

12:51.380 --> 12:55.210
Yeah. It's thanks to you guys.

12:59.460 --> 13:00.890
The Dark Armour Blade!

13:00.890 --> 13:07.640
Even an immortal Dark Blade
cannot be restored with its blade gone.

13:08.300 --> 13:11.310
The Dark Blade is dead.

13:11.310 --> 13:12.730
I'm sorry.

13:12.730 --> 13:16.070
Don't worry. Your life is more valuable.

13:16.070 --> 13:17.600
Thanks.

13:18.020 --> 13:20.070
That's right! Popp!

13:20.070 --> 13:23.110
Yes! Popp is all right as well!

13:25.860 --> 13:27.240
No...

13:27.240 --> 13:28.160
Leona?

13:29.200 --> 13:32.660
Popp... can't be resurrected.

13:34.120 --> 13:37.210
That's impossible! He just...

13:37.210 --> 13:40.800
That's right! He cast a spell!

13:40.800 --> 13:44.590
I don't understand why that happened.

13:44.970 --> 13:49.260
But, my Zing spell didn't work!

13:49.680 --> 13:53.850
I'm sorry! I wasn't strong enough!

13:55.140 --> 13:56.480
No...

13:57.270 --> 14:00.060
Say it isn't true, Popp.

14:00.810 --> 14:02.070
Please!

14:02.520 --> 14:05.870
Open your eyes! Popp!

14:05.870 --> 14:09.160
Popp!

14:34.220 --> 14:35.390
Baran?!

14:47.610 --> 14:49.540
Don't bother bluffing.

14:49.540 --> 14:55.410
I know you don't have
a bit of strength left.

14:58.410 --> 15:00.000
Like myself.

15:06.010 --> 15:09.090
<i>His heart has definitely stopped.</i>

15:09.720 --> 15:11.260
<i>And yet, how...?</i>

15:11.930 --> 15:15.190
<i>Did his feelings for his friend</i>

15:15.190 --> 15:20.190
<i>cause this dead boy's body to move?</i>

15:20.810 --> 15:22.730
<i>Is such a miracle possible?</i>

15:24.980 --> 15:26.360
<i>How ironic.</i>

15:27.230 --> 15:31.660
<i>The power of Dragons,
magic of Darklings, and heart of humans.</i>

15:32.450 --> 15:36.250
<i>Of the three gifts
granted to a Dragon Knight,</i>

15:36.250 --> 15:40.250
<i>for the human heart
I cast aside as useless...</i>

15:42.580 --> 15:46.460
<i>to deal such crushing blows to me.</i>

15:58.640 --> 16:00.350
What are you doing?

16:11.280 --> 16:14.540
Dino, I have nothing to say.

16:14.540 --> 16:18.040
Take the path that you believe is right.

16:18.790 --> 16:23.050
However, this world has no use
for two Dragon Knights!

16:23.050 --> 16:27.250
Once my blade is restored
and my wounds healed...

16:28.130 --> 16:30.090
we shall settle this!

16:30.090 --> 16:32.260
You're returning to the Dark Army?

16:32.260 --> 16:35.390
I no longer care about the Dark Army.

16:36.010 --> 16:38.060
If you defeat me,

16:38.060 --> 16:41.390
you can go on to destroy
the Dark Army for the humans.

16:41.890 --> 16:44.110
But if I win...

16:44.110 --> 16:47.320
I will wipe out the humans!

16:47.320 --> 16:49.360
You're still saying that?!

16:49.820 --> 16:54.830
It's too late to change my ways.
This is just how it is for adults.

16:54.830 --> 16:56.530
You stubborn idiot!

16:58.580 --> 17:00.490
Say what you will.

17:15.630 --> 17:16.930
Popp is...!

17:18.140 --> 17:20.930
He's alive again! He has a pulse!

17:22.350 --> 17:23.430
Popp?!

17:23.980 --> 17:26.850
The boy is tougher than he looks.

17:27.400 --> 17:28.770
Did you...?!

17:30.480 --> 17:34.360
This is the first and last time
I offer a gift to an enemy.

17:34.860 --> 17:37.200
Next time we meet, I won't hold back.

17:38.070 --> 17:39.200
Dino!

17:39.620 --> 17:40.740
No...

17:41.200 --> 17:42.490
Dai!

17:44.910 --> 17:46.750
You've been warned!

17:48.710 --> 17:52.590
<i>Baran has regained his human heart.</i>

17:53.130 --> 18:00.050
<i>That's why, to atone for his sins,
he wants his own son to take him down.</i>

18:00.720 --> 18:06.140
<i>He truly is tragically powerful
and ever alone.</i>

18:12.570 --> 18:15.820
It's the worst possible outcome!

18:15.820 --> 18:20.660
Baran survived
and Dai's powers have begun to awaken!

18:21.370 --> 18:23.750
At this rate, I'll...

18:23.750 --> 18:25.500
I'll...

18:25.500 --> 18:27.710
Dark Commander Hadlar.

18:30.420 --> 18:33.710
His Majesty, Dark King Vearn summons you.

18:35.300 --> 18:38.260
Hadlar, raise your head.

18:40.260 --> 18:43.520
What's wrong? Raise your head.

18:43.520 --> 18:46.520
I-I beg for forgiveness, King Vearn!

18:46.520 --> 18:50.360
Baran's failure
is my responsibility as his superior!

18:50.360 --> 18:52.820
When he returns, I shall make sure to...

18:52.820 --> 18:54.190
Fool!

18:55.440 --> 18:58.400
Baran will likely never return.

18:59.410 --> 19:02.790
Considering his personality,

19:02.790 --> 19:06.790
I doubt he'll do anything
unless it involves Dai.

19:07.580 --> 19:09.500
Baran's failure

19:09.500 --> 19:15.710
is your crime for hiding that Dai was
a Dragon Knight even from me!

19:17.460 --> 19:22.300
This is the result
of your petty little games!

19:24.510 --> 19:30.600
Baran is the only being in the world
who has the power to resist me.

19:31.440 --> 19:38.070
Convincing him to become an ally
was not an easy task.

19:39.900 --> 19:44.120
I'll say it once more, raise your head.

19:49.710 --> 19:52.210
I am a tolerant man.

19:52.710 --> 19:56.420
I will forgive up to three failures.

19:56.750 --> 19:58.090
However...

19:58.920 --> 20:03.510
<i>you've cost us Romos Kingdom
and Papnica kingdom,</i>

20:04.010 --> 20:09.520
<i>allowing two of our Legion Commanders
to join the other side.</i>

20:10.480 --> 20:13.230
And on Valge Island...

20:13.810 --> 20:18.400
<i>despite leading an army,
you failed to kill Dai.</i>

20:20.490 --> 20:25.030
And now, this incident with Baran...

20:30.950 --> 20:31.910
However...

20:32.870 --> 20:38.460
I did not forget
that you slew Avan, the Hero.

20:40.010 --> 20:43.720
Hadlar, this is your last chance.

20:44.180 --> 20:47.810
When you next appear before me,

20:47.810 --> 20:53.060
if Dai and his friends
have not been wiped out,

20:53.390 --> 20:57.440
my third finger shall drop.

20:57.820 --> 20:58.990
Am I understood?

20:58.990 --> 21:01.700
Y-Yes, my king!

21:01.700 --> 21:06.120
I, Hadlar, shall stake my life on it!

21:06.120 --> 21:08.330
Very well. Go.

21:08.330 --> 21:09.540
My king!

21:18.210 --> 21:22.090
Shouldn't we just kill him?

21:22.380 --> 21:26.270
I have given him the ultimate body.

21:26.270 --> 21:30.640
If he cannot win,
then the weakness is in his mind.

21:30.640 --> 21:35.820
Driven to desperation,
he may actually prove his worth.

21:35.820 --> 21:38.740
We can kill him anytime.

21:38.740 --> 21:42.870
Amazing, King Vearn.
You've thought of everything.

21:42.870 --> 21:45.070
King Vearn, hooray! Hooray!

21:45.530 --> 21:48.490
Let us sit back and enjoy...

21:49.330 --> 21:53.330
the final charge of the Hadlar Legion.

22:04.340 --> 22:07.300
<i>tatoe akuma ni seiron kazashite
mukatte mitemo</i>

22:04.340 --> 22:07.300
<i>Even if you face the devil
With logic on your side</i>

22:07.470 --> 22:11.260
<i>sore wa akumade seitouka
sashite chigai wa naikamo</i>

22:07.470 --> 22:11.260
<i>It may just be a rationalization</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:15.350
<i>ima mo ima mo yureteiru kedo</i>

22:11.430 --> 22:15.350
<i>Even now, even now I waver</i>

22:15.520 --> 22:19.400
<i>bokura wa dokomade yukuno</i>

22:15.520 --> 22:19.400
<i>How far will we go?</i>

22:19.560 --> 22:22.690
<i>tenshi no sasayaki nimo nita
koe ga kikoeta</i>

22:19.560 --> 22:22.690
<i>I heard a voice like an angel's whisper</i>

22:22.860 --> 22:26.610
<i>hatamata petenshi no mayakashi
hitokiwa mimi ni hibiiteita</i>

22:22.860 --> 22:26.610
<i>Maybe it was an imposter's illusion
It still rang in my ears</i>

22:26.780 --> 22:30.320
<i>ai ni hiai ni sarasare nagara</i>

22:26.780 --> 22:30.320
<i>Exposed to love and sorrow</i>

22:30.490 --> 22:34.620
<i>hokori mamire michi no tochu</i>

22:30.490 --> 22:34.620
<i>On the path strewn with pride</i>

22:36.330 --> 22:38.670
<i>kiete wa ukabu touhikou</i>

22:36.330 --> 22:38.670
<i>Fleeting moments of cowardice</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:42.460
<i>nomikonda SOS</i>

22:40.210 --> 22:42.460
<i>The SOS I held back</i>

22:44.050 --> 22:48.050
<i>furueru te wo nigirishimeta</i>

22:44.050 --> 22:48.050
<i>I clenched my trembling fist</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.640
<i>tatta hitotsu no chiisana yakusoku ga</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:53.640
<i>That single little promise</i>

22:53.810 --> 22:57.430
<i>honno sasaina omoidetachi ga</i>

22:53.810 --> 22:57.430
<i>Those trivial little memories</i>

22:57.600 --> 22:59.730
<i>itsumade tattemo kono mune wo</i>

22:57.600 --> 22:59.730
<i>They're still in my heart</i>

22:59.900 --> 23:03.900
<i>kogashi tsuzukeru tomoshibi ni naru</i>

22:59.900 --> 23:03.900
<i>As embers that keep me burning</i>

23:04.070 --> 23:08.400
<i>A single transparent beam of light</i>

23:04.070 --> 23:08.400
<i>tada hitosuji no toumei na hikari ga</i>

23:08.570 --> 23:11.570
<i>Lights the way before me</i>

23:08.570 --> 23:11.570
<i>me no mae wo terashite yuku</i>

23:11.740 --> 23:16.250
<i>There is little that I can do</i>

23:11.740 --> 23:16.250
<i>boku ni dekiru koto wa ikutsu mo naisa</i>

23:16.410 --> 23:22.460
<i>Just keep on to the future
I managed to grasp through my faith</i>

23:16.410 --> 23:22.460
<i>shinjinuita saki ni te ni shita mirai wo
susunde yuke</i>

23:35.060 --> 23:36.930
<i>After the battle with Baran,</i>

23:37.100 --> 23:41.730
<i>Dai and friends stop by Merle's house,
but the Dark Army offers no rest.</i>

23:42.480 --> 23:49.030
<i>The next assassin is the desperate Hadlar,
with one last chance from Dark King Vearn,</i>

23:49.240 --> 23:51.530
<i>and Zaboera, the Mystic Bishop.</i>

23:51.910 --> 23:54.370
DRAGON QUEST The Adventure of Dai<i>,</i>

23:54.530 --> 23:56.330
<i>"Zaboera's Scheme"</i>

23:56.490 --> 23:58.700
<i>The adventure continues!</i>

23:58.700 --> 24:00.710


24:00.710 --> 24:02.660

